00:02:56.880 --> 00:02:57.880
We've never done better.

00:02:57.880 --> 00:03:04.479
We've had, I think, 58 stock market increases since I've been top, meaning record increases.

00:03:04.479 --> 00:03:06.320
We have never seen anything like it.

00:03:06.320 --> 00:03:09.039
And we're going to keep it going.

00:03:09.039 --> 00:03:11.800
That makes it a little bit easier for what we're doing.

00:03:11.800 --> 00:03:16.520
I guess maybe it also makes some people crazy because they don't want to see us do well.

00:03:16.520 --> 00:03:19.960
But we're the hottest nation anywhere in the world, and we were a dead nation one year

00:03:19.960 --> 00:03:20.960
