00:03:36.639 --> 00:03:41.600
East and all of the things you see is they respect our nation.

00:03:41.600 --> 00:03:43.440
A year ago, you wouldn't have been able to get it.

00:03:43.440 --> 00:03:44.960
You certainly couldn't have gotten it with Biden.

00:03:44.960 --> 00:03:46.919
You didn't know where the hell he was.

00:03:46.919 --> 00:03:50.080
But a year ago, you wouldn't have been able to have a situation like this.

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:54.279
So I just want to thank the people around this table and certainly the officials around

00:03:54.279 --> 00:03:56.479
the table because they've been incredible.

00:03:56.479 --> 00:03:57.479
They've been brave.

